<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">2 BaKolinte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Lwabili LwaPaulu KubaKolinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 BaKolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Bak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Lwabili LwaPaulu</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUBAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwhalo yaBakolinte yabili yakakwalwa noMpositoli Paulu makole angaba makumi mashanu anamashanu zwinda kumakumi mashanu namashanu analimwempela mushule mokuzwalwa kwaKristo (2 BaKolinte 1:1). Yolu lukwalo lwabili pamakwalo mabili atinanawo akakwalwa naPaulu kugubungano lyokuKolinte. Bobumhizha bwewhalo jeBhayibhili banobimba kuti Paulu wakabakwala lukwalo lunolwaja kubaKolinte mushule. Atinanalo lukwalo yolu lwaanolebeleka nezwalo pana (2 BaKolinte 2:3-4). Iwhalo yabaBakolinte babili ingaba yakakwalwa naPaulu paakaba eli kuMasedonia (2 BaKolinte 2:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwhalo yabaKolinte babili ilosiyana nejimwe pakuti yakakwalilwa ikananga kulebeleka nonhu sezwaali akale imusa ishungu jomoyo. Paulu unotondeja lushanto lulwe pezhulu pobusumikiji bubuya bwaakatambula kuva kunaTaitasi pezhulu pegubungano lyokuKolinte. Mulukwalo yolu, tinowana indayijo izhele pezhulu pokupa nenzila yeChivumilano Chipya, muchikamu Paulu paanopa indayijo pezhulu pokubunganisa imali inonda kunobhancha banakwaina kuJelusalema (2 BaKolinte 8:1—9:15). Zwinoboneka sofana bamwe bapositoli bamaniepwa bokuzhe kwegubungano bakabeshingisa kumukila kwabamwe banhu mugubungano kulwisa Paulu akale nokuzwinyamula ibo nokwabo. Bakabeta kuti besidimbwe isimba lyobupositoli lipo panaPaulu, zwingaba zwakontisa kuti esimise isimba lilye sompositoli waJesu Kristo kumapejelejo ewhalo yabaKolinte babili.</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unotanga lukwalo lulwe nokumusa igubungano (2 BaKolinte 1:1-7).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova Paulu elebeleka nezwokushanduka kobulongwa bolwendo lulwe akale pezhulu penyaya yaakawha pezhulu pabo akale nokuti bakatani pabakatambula lukwalo lwaakababatumijila mushule (2 BaKolinte 1:8—7:16).</para>
  <para style="io1">Mushule mwezwi Paulu unopa indayo pezhulu pokubunganisa imali inonda kubanakwaina bokuJelusalema (2 BaKolinte 8:1—9:15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kopejeleja, Paulu unolwilila bupositoli bubwe, esiko babuja nezwokubashanyila kukwe kuchatobela (2 BaKolinte 10:1—13:10).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Imi Paulu, umpositoli waKristo Jesu nechido chaMwali, naTimoti mwanakwaina wedu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Ndikumukwalila igubungano lyaMwali likokuguta igulwana liko kuKolinte, nabachena bose baimo mudunhu igulwana lyeAkeya yose.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Chipiwo nolunyalalo kunamwi zwiva kunaMwali Tate bedu akale nokunaTezi Jesu Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu Unoboka Mwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Mwali ngekombolelwe Tate baTezi wedu Jesu Kristo, Tate beshe akale Mwali unotipa imbalaijo yose, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />iye unotinyalaja mumasheto edu wose, kutila kuti titubule kunyalaja yabo baimo mumasheto angaba kana api zwawo, nolubalaijo Mwali lwanotibalaija nalo. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kana tisheteswa kasa nokuda kwaKristu ndipo patinowha kubalaijwa kulopamijwa munaKristo. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Kana tisheteswa, lubalaijo noluchijo lwenu, akale kana tibalaijwa, ngezwo lubalaijo lwenu, lwamulozibila mungota umoyo undefu mwakabhatilila mukusheteswa zwatikumutiwa. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Lubimbo lwedu namwi alutodengeda, nokuti tinoziba kuti sezwo mulina unkobe mumasheto edu, mooba nenkobe mulubalaijo lwedu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Banakwaina, atidi kuti musibe noluzibo, nezwamasheto makulwana atakashangana nawo muEzhiya, zwakatiswincha pakulasha lubimbo lwobupenyu. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Chokomende takawha sabatongelwa lufu, koga yezwi zwakatikana kuti tisizwibimbe isu nokwedu, koga tibimbe naMwali unomusa bakafa, <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />wakatisungunula mugubaji igulwana lyolufu, akale unootisungunula akale. Panaiye ndipo patabiga lubimbo lwedu kuti unootisungunula akale, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />pamunotibhancha neminamato yenu. Pakalepo banhu banji banoboka bakatimililila pezhulu pamakombolelo atakapiwa ilinshandulo inova kuminamato yabanhu banji.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inshanduko Muzwilongwa ZwaPaulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Nokuti kushiya kwedu busumikiji boluyeyo lwedu luchena kuti takabelalama mubuchena akale nomuchokomende kasa mukulyijana namwi, akale takabebimba nechipiwo chaMwali kusi nobuchenjevu bwabanhu. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Nokuti tomukwalila chete zwamunotubula kubala akale muwhisisa. Ndinalubimbo kuti mozwiwhisisa kuzhele, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />sezwamwawhisisa muchikamu, kuti mungashiya nasu sezwatinoota namwi, nezhuba lyaTezi Jesu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Nokuti ndakabakasimisa nezwi, ndakabeda kutanga kuzha kwamuli kuti mubenokunakilijwa kulopamwa, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />ndaandida kumushanyila ndichinonda kuMasedoniya, akale kuzha kwamuli ndiva kuMasedoniya akale kuti mundipindilije mulwendo lwangu lwokunda kuJudiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ndakabekahajika na pandakabeda kuta yezwi? Ndota zwilongwa zwangu sonhu wenyika na, ndakazwilonganyila kuti, “Eya” nokuti, “Pe,” panhu pamwempela? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Chokomende sezwo Mwali ekabimbika, mawhi edu kwamuli aatoba okuti “Eya,” akale “Pe.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Nokuti Mwananhulumyana waMwali, Jesu Kristo, utakabhaunula pakati penu, Imi, Silivanasi naTimoti, wakaba esi, “Eya” na “Pe,” koga muna Iye ndi, “Eya” unshaji wose. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Nokuti zwose zwibimbiso zwaMwali ndi Eya. Nokudalo munaKristo tinoti Ameni tikuja Mwali. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />NdiMwali unotigajika zwilozikatila isu namwi munaKristo. Akale wakatishala, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />akabiga imhande yiye panasu sechitondejo chokuti tilibabe, akale akatipa uMpepo uwe mumyoyo yedu sechibimbiso chezwinhu zwichinozha.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Koga ndoshoba Mwali kuti ebe unsumikiji, kumuwhila ishe kwakata kuti ndisizhe kuKolinte. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Kusi kumubhata nesimba mukudimbwa kwenu, toshinga namwi titila lushanto lwenu, nokuti mulosima mukudimbwa kwenu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ndakalangalila kuti ndisipamhe kumushanyila zwinoomulwajisa moyo akale. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Nokuti kana ndita kuti mulwajilwe, ndiani biya uchandishantisa koga wakaleyo undimuwhisa kulwaja? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Akale ndakakwala sobundakata, kuti ndingoozha ndisiwhiswe kulwaja kunaabo babekwelela kundishantisa, nokuti ndakabebimba namwi mose, kuti kushanta kwangu kube kushanta kwenu mose. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Nokuti ndakamukwalila nokuyabiswa kukulwana akale nokulwajilwa kwomoyo akale nemishoji minji, kusikuda kuti mulwajilwe koga kumuzibisa buwando boludo lwangu kwamuli.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulekejelwa Konchinyi Yoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Koga kana pelina wakatisa kuti kube nokulwajilwa, aajakatila imi pe, koga neimwe inzila ndisinokantula wakatila imwi mose. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Kunooyo wakadalo yechi chilango chabanji chilozhulila, <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />sokudalo mokwelela muundekejele nokuunyalaja, nokuti angakubukilwa neshungu ihulwana. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Nezwo ndomukumbila kuti muuntondejele akale ludo lwenu. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Yezwi ndizwo zwakatisa kuti ndikwale, kuti ndimukweje akale kuti ndizibe kana mowhilila na muzwinhu zwose. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Yoyo wamunolekejela, namibo ndondekejela. Yezwo zwandalekejela, kana pelina zwokulekejela, zwatilwa imwi nokuba ipo kwaKristo, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kutila kuti Satani esiwane isimba pezhulu pedu, nokuti tobuziba buchengeji bubwe.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubilila KwaPaulu MuToluwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Pandakezha kuToluwasi kobhaunula iNdebo iMbuya yaKristo, ndakazhulilwa unkoba munaTezi, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />koga indangalilo yangu ayijakagajikana nokuti mwanakwaina wangu Taitasi andijakongwana kwakale. Nokudalo ndakabakoneka ndikenda kuMasedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzunda MunaKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Koga Mwali ngebokwe, Iye munaKristo unotitungamila mukukoma unshaji wose, akale nomunasu unomwalaja bunde boluzibo lulwe kwosekwose. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Nokuti tibunde bwaKristo kunaMwali mukati mwaabo bamuchijwa naabo bamupalala, <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />kuna umwe tilupepo lunonhuwa zwitungamija kulufu, asi kuna umwe tibunde bunonhuwilila bubuza bupenyu. Ndiani unotubula kuta unshingo yoyu? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Isu atinanga, sabanjinji, batengesi beWhi lyaMwali, koga sabanhu bechokomende, koga Mwali wakatituma, tolebeleka muchokokomende pambeli paMwali munaKristo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Bashingi BeChivumilano Chipya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Timutangisa kuzwisuma akale na? Kana kuti kunodikana makwalo okutisuma kwamuli, kana anova kwamuli, sezwinota bamwe? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Imwi momene ndimwi lukwalo lwedu, lulokwalwa mumyoyo yedu, lunozibikana akale lubalwa nabanhu bose. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Motondejela pachena kuti mulukwalo lunova kunaKristo lwakabuzwa nasu, lusakakwalwa noluboko koga noMpepo waMwali umpenyu, pesi pezwipemu zwamabwe mapapalaza, koga pemyoyo yabanhu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Yolu ndilolubimbo lwatinanalo kupinda munaKristo tinda kunaMwali. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Azwitova kuti totubula nokwedu kuti titi yezwi zwatiwa nasu, koga zwinova kunaMwali, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />iye wakatita kuti titubule kubabashingi bechivumilano chipya, chisi chomulawo ulokwalwa koga choMpepo, mulawo ulokwalwa unobulaya koga uMpepo unopa bupenyu.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ngweno kana unshaji wolufu wakabakakwalwa pebwe, wakezha nokungaima kukulwana zwakata kuti baIzilayeli bekonwe kulinga kumesho kwaMozesi nokutaima kwako, kojoba kujujuka sozwakuli, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />unshaji woMpepo autoba nokungaima kukulwana kupinda na? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Kana kwakaba nokungaima nonshaji wokulashwa, unshaji wobululami ulokwelela kuba nokungaima kulopindilija. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Chokomende, nenyaya yeyi, yezwo zwakaba zwingaima noyo unshaji azwichinongaima, nokuti kungaima kwabaipo kunopinda kwakabelipo. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Kana yezwo zwakajujuka zwakezha nokungaima, yezwo zwisinopela zwinokwelela kuba nokungaima kulopindilila.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Sobutina lubimbo lwakadai, tinamyoyo misimu, <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />atitoba saMozesi wakafuka kumesho kukwe noncheka etila kuti baIzilayeli besibone kupela kokungaima. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Koga indangalilo jabo jakakomeswa, kuswikila izhuba lyanasi, pabanobala chivumilano chantolo, uncheka wakale yondwa aujanu wafukulwa, nokuti munaKristo chete ndimo mwaunobhiswa. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Eya, kuswikila nasi yono, panobalwa iwhalo yaMozesi uncheka ulofuka indangalilo jabo, <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />koga unhu angochingunukila kuna Tezi, uncheka unofukulwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Ngweno Tezi uMpepo, akale panaMpepo waTezi, pana lusungunuko. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Akale isu tose, tilina kumesho kwakafukulwa, totondeja kungaima kwakaleko kunova kunaTezi uliMpepo, kumushandulwa kuti titojane naye kuva kuna kumwe kungaima kunda kuna kumwe.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Ifuma YoMpepo Muhali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nokudalo, tinanonshingo yoyu neshe jaMwali, atitobola moyo. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Talamba zwinosheshemesa zwinotiwa musiswa, inzila jobuchengeji kana kubhilinganya iwhi lyaMwali, koga nokulungulula ichokomende pachena tinozwilebelekela kuti titambulwe noluyeyo lwabanhu bose pambeli paMwali. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Akale kojoba iNdebo iMbuya yakafukwa, ilofukwa chete kunaabo bamupalala. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Munyaya yeyi, mwali wopasi yopano wakapofumaja indangalilo jabasinodimbwa, kutila kuti besibone mwenje weNdebo iMbuya wokungaima kwaKristo, iye ulichitojaniso chaMwali. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Atijikumuzwibhaunula nokwedu, koga Jesu Kristo saTezi, isu sabashingi benu titila Jesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Nokuti Mwali wakati, “Lumuniko ngalumunike munhilima,” ndiye wakamunikila myoyo yedu kutipa chimuniko choluzibo chokungaima kwaMwali chinoboneka muchiso chaKristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Koga tinanefuma yeyi muhali, kutondejela kuti isimba yeli linoshamisa linova kunaMwali akale kuti alitoba lyedu. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Tikumuyabiswa munzila jose, koga atijimuziyiwa, tikumukankabajwa, koga atijimulasha moyo, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />timujiijwa, koga atijilolashwa, timulobwa tiwigilwa pasi, koga atijimupalajwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Unshaji wose tikasenga lufu lwaJesu mumibili yedu, kutila kuti bupenyu bwaJesu butondejelwe bo mumibili yedu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Nokuti tichibapenyu timupilwa kulufu unshaji wose pezhulu paJesu, kuti bupenyu bwaJesu butondejelwe mumibili yedu inofa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Nokudalo kufa kumushinga munasu, koga bupenyu bukumushinga mwamuli.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Sezwo tilina umpepo umwempela wokudimbwa sokuleba kwewhalo inchena kuti, “Ndakadimbwa, nokudalo ndakalebeleka,” nasubo todimbwa, nokudalo tolebeleka, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Nokuti tinoziba kuti yoyo wakamusa Tezi Jesu unootimusa bo naJesu akale etibuze pamwempela namwi ikokwaali. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Nokuti zwose zwinotilwa imwi, kuti chipiwo pachimumwalajwa kubanhu banjinji chinoota kuti kubenokuboka kukulwana, kuchapalukujo kunaMwali.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulalama Nokudimbwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Nokudalo atitobola moyo. Kojoba mibili yedu ilimukushakala, umpepo wedu mukati ukumutiwa umpya izhuba nezhuba. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Nokuti yoku kuyabiswa konshaji unshomanana kukumutilonganyila lukujo lukulwana lusinopela lusinopanikijwa nokuyabiswa kwomushule, <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />nokuti atitolinga kuzwinhu zwinoboneka koga kuzwinhu zwisinoboneka, nokuti zwinoboneka zwinopela, koga zwisinoboneka azwitopela.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Nokuti toziba kuti kana unshasha mwatigele wopenyika ungozakunyulwa, tina nechibakwa chinova kunaMwali, ingumba isakabakwa namaboko, yemisi isinopela kumatenga. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Yopano chokomende tikumumimila, akale tikumulakamila kumbala ingumba yedu yokudenga, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />kutila kuti kuyimbala kwedu kute kuti tisiwanikwe tili chinkuna. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Nokuti kana tichimunshasha yoyu, totula ibhika lyokubilila, nokuti atidi kumbulwa, koga kuti timbajikwe mibili yokudenga, kutila kuti chinofa chiminywe nobupenyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Iye wakatibambanyila yechi chinhu ndiMwali, iye wakatipa uMpepo sechibimbiso.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Nokudalo, tilosima unshaji wose, toziba kuti kana tichimumbili, tiko kule naTezi, <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />nokuti tokwenda nokudimbwa, kusi nokubona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Tina myoyo, akale tokwemuja kubhuda mumbili yoyu, akale tibe kusha naTezi. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Kojoba tili kusha kana tisi kwakale, tinota kuti chibe chinangwa chedu kuunshantisa. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Nokuti tose tooma pambeli pechigalo chobutongi chaKristo, kuti umwe noumwe enambijwe bubuya kana bubi, zwikwendelana nozwaakata echimumbili uwe.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bukamu NaMwali NomunaKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Nokudalo, nokuziba kutya Tezi, tobabweta banhu, koga zwatili zwinozibikana kunaMwali, akale ndobimba kuti tozibikana mumiyeyo yenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Atijikumuzwisuma isu kunamwi kabili koga timumupa zwingata kuti mushiye nasu, kutila kuti mushandule yabo banoshiya nobukulwana bonhu usimoyo uwe. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false" /></note> <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Nokuti kana tipenga, ngezwaMwali, kana tilimundangalilo jedu jizhele ngozwenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Nokuti ludo lwaKristo lunotichinga, nokuti tilogunchikana kuti unhu umwempela wakafila bose, nokudalo bose bakafa. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Akale iye wakafila bose, kuti yabo bapenyu besizwigalile ibo nokwabo koga begalile iye wakabafila akale akamuswa. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Kuva ngweno zwindilambeli, atichinolinga kana aanhi nenzila yobunhu, kojoba noumwe unshaji takabelinga Kristo nenzila yobunhu, koga ngweno atichinondinga alo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Nokudalo, wose umo munaKristo, waba chibumbwa chipya, zwantolo zwapinda, chokomende zwipya zwezha. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Zwose yezwi zwinova kunaMwali, munaKristo wakatita kuti tibwilizane naye akale akatipa unshingo wokubwilizana, <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />kuti, munaKristo Mwali wakata kuti ebwilizana nenyika kwaali, esinolaba luchinyo lwabo, akale ebhatisa isu chilayo chokubwilizana. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Sezwo tilibamilili baKristo, Mwali unoteteja eshingisa isu. Tomubweta takamilila Kristo, bwilizanani naMwali. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Pezhulu pedu Mwali wakoonta luchinyo iye usakabeziba luchinyo, kutila kuti munaiye tibe balolulama baMwali.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Tili bashingi pamwempela naMwali, tomubweta kuti musitambule chipiwo chaMwali zwisina unshingo. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Nokuti iye unoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Nonshaji ulokwelela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">ndakamuwha, akale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ndikamubhancha nezhuba lyokuchijwa”.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Ilingani, ngweno ndiwo unshaji ulokwelela, ngweno ndilyo izhuba lyoluchijo.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Atitobiga chikoneso munzila kana yani, kutila kuti pesibe uchawana kulundula munshingo wedu, <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />koga sabashingi baMwali tozwilebelekela isu tomene munzila jose, nokutobeleja kukulugulu, mukusheteswa, mubukukutu, munjabulo, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />mukulobwa, mukusungwa, mubhilimanyondo, mukushinga kasa, mukusolala ihope busiku, nomunzhala. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Mubuchena, muluzibo, mukuzwibhata, mushe, muMpepo uNchena, muludo lwechokomende, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />mundebo yechokomende, akale nesimba lyaMwali, nezwilwaniso zwobululami kuluboko lokululyi akale nokuluboko lokuchesho, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />mulukujo nomusheshemo, mumpuwo imbi nomumpuwo imbuya. Titolwa sezwitwakubili, koga tilimuchokomende, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />sabasinozibikana, koga tizibikana kasa, sabamufa koga tibapenyu, sabakalangwa koga tisakabulayiwa, <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />sabaneshungu, koga tigala tikashanta unshaji wose, sabasheti, koga tifumisa banji, sabasina chinhu, koga tili nezwinhu zwose.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />BaKolinte tinolebeleka takasupuka kwamuli, moyo wedu ulozhulika. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ludo lwedu kwamuli alujilojibijwa, asi mwajibija ludo lwenu kunasu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ngweno ndikumulebeleka sokuti mubana bangu, tikwazabulileni myoyo yenu namwibo.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chichenjejo Nokupambulwa Nozwechihedeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Musijogwe pamwempela nabasinodimbwa. Nokuti zwinolyijana chini bululami nobubi? Kana kuti mwenje nenhilima zwinokamujana chini? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kristo angawhanana chini naguluzhanje? Kana kuti undimbwi unoshangana chini nousinodimbwa? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ngechipi chivumilano chingaba pakati petempeli lyaMwali nezwimwali? Nokuti isu titempeli lyaMwali umpenyu, sezwakaleba iye Mwali eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Ndoogala mwabali akale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ndookwenda mukati mwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">ndooba Mwali wabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ibo banooba banhu bangu. <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Nokudalo Tezi unoti, “bhudani mwabali, mupambukane nabo, akale musibhate zweshambwa, ndipo pandichamutambula, <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />akale ndoobaTate benu, imwi mooba bana bangu banhulumyana nabanhukajana.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Bakwaina banodikana, sezwo tilina zwibimbiso yezwi, ngatizwishampulujeni nokwedu kunazwose zwinotiswibhisa mumbili nomumpepo, akale tibe bachena zwilopelelela mukutya Mwali.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lushanto lwaPaulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Tizhulileni myoyo yenu, atijakachinyila kana aani, apana utakaswibhisa, atijakachebela unhu. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Andijimuleba yezwi kuti ndimulashe, nokuti ndaleba kale kuti mumomumyoyo yedu, tofila pamwempela akale tokugala pamwempela. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ndinalubimbo lukulwana kasakasa namwi, ndoshiya kasa namwi, ndilozhajwa nolunyalajo. Kojoba masheto edu ose akatimoma, ndiloshantilwa kasakasa.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Patakaswika kuMasedoniya, atijakawana kunyetutukwa, koga takayabiswa munzila jose kujumbulana kuzhe, akale lutyo mumyoyo. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Koga Mwali unonyalaja balohetela, wakatinyalaja nokuswika kwaTaitasi, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />akale kusi kuzha kukwe chete koga takanyalajwa akale nenzila imwakombalaija nayo, etibuja nokutizwimba kwenu, nokutilila kwenu, nobusungwaji bwenu kwandili, zwakata kuti ndibe nolushanto lukulwana. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Kojoba ndakata kuti muhushubale nolukwalo lwangu, andineshungu nazwo (kojoba ndakababa neshungu nazwo), nokuti ndakabona kuti lukwalo yolo lwakamupisa ishungu, kwonshaji unshomanana chete. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ngweno ndiloshantilwa, kusi kuti mwakawha ishungu, koga nokuti mwakawha ishungu jakamuta kuti mushanduke, nokuti mwakawha ishungu jobumwali, sezwo apana chimwakalashikilwa mwatili. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Nokuti kulwajilwa nomwoyo mubumwali kunobuza kushanduka, kunobuza luchijo akale kusinobuza ishungu, koga kulwajilwa nomwoyo sabenyika kunobuza lufu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Sezwo ilingani kuti kusungwala kwenu neshungu jobumwali kwazwalani mwamuli, kufundumala ni kuti muzwichenese, kunyema ni, kukatamukani, kuzwimbuluka ni, kusungwala ni, kulangwa ni! Munzila yose mwasimatija kuti amunandandu muneyi inyaya.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Kojoba ndakamukwalila, akujakabeli pezhulu poyo wakabipisa, kana poyo wakabipisilwa, koga kutila kuti kusungwala kwenu kwatili kube pachena kunamwi mumesho aMwali. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Nokudalo tilonyalajwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Akale kuzhe kokunyalajwa kwedu isu takashantiswa nokushanta kwaTaitasi, nokuti imwi mose mwakanyetutusa moyo uwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Nokuti kana pana zwandakaleba kwaali neshiyo lyandinanalyo munamwi, andijakaswabiswa, koga sazwose zwatakaleba kwamuli ichokomende, nokudalo kuzwitunha kwedu kunaTaitasi kwakasimatijwa muchokomende. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Akale moyo uwe uzhele noludo lwilopamijika, pakumukumbulukwa kuwhilila kwenu mose, akale nokuuntambula kwenu mulukujo nokuundemekeja. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ndoshantilwa kuti munazwose ndinalubimbo luzhele namwi.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kupa Kwamakristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Toda kumubuja, banakwaina, nezwechipiwo Mwali chaakapa kumakubungano okuMasedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Mukusheteswa kwabo kukulwana, nolushanto lwabo lukulwana akale nobusheti bwabo bukulwana zwakafwashukila mubufumi bweshe jabo. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ndinosumikija kuti bakapa umwenoumwe sokutubula kukwe, akale bepindija kutubula kwabo. Sechido chabo bakasununguka, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />betikumbila nesimba kuti bevumilwe kubhancha kunyetutuja bachena. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Yezwi, zwisi sokulingilila kwedu, koga chokutanga bakazwipila kunaTezi noku nasu muchido chaMwali. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Sezwazwili, tasungwaaja Taitasi kuti sezwo wakabatanga kale unshingo umbuya yoyu mukati mwenu, kuti oompejeleje yoyu unshingo weshe. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Ngweno sezwo mubhudilila muzwinhu zwose, mukudimbwa, mukulebeleka, muluzibo, mukusungwala, nomuludo lwenu kwatili, akale mubone kuti mota zwibuyanana panshingo yoyu weshe wokupa. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Andijimuleba yezwi sondayo, koga ndikumukweja kubimbika kwenu kwoludo ndikwejanisa nokusungwala kwatondejwa nabamwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Nokuti imwi mojiziba iShe jaTezi wedu Jesu Kristo, kuti kojoba akabakafuma, pezhulu penu wakaba unsheti, kutila kuti mubusheti bubwe imwi mufume.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Akale munyaya yeyi ndopa chilayilo changu, zwibuya kuti mupejise ngweno zwamwakatangisa kuta igole lyapinda, ndimwi bokutanga kupa akale nokuba nechido chokuzwita. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Asi ngweno pejisani zwamwakatanga kuta. Kutila kuti mupe sezwamwakabeda, mungazwipejeleja zwikwendelana nezwamunanazwo. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Kana chido chokupa chilipo, chipo chinotambulika zwinda nezwaana nazwo kusi zwasinanazo.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Andijimuleba kuti bamwe begalikane akale imwi mulemelwe, koga kuti kube nokukwelana. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Ngweno munanezwinji kuti mubhanche mukushaiwa kwabo nonshaji youno kutila kuti limwe zhuba bakangoba nezwinji bopila bo kushayiwa kweku kuti kube nokukwelana. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Sezwazwilokwalwa mulukwalo luchena kuti, “Yoyo wakabunganisa zwinji aajakaba nezwinji kupindilija, nooyo wakabunganisa zwishoma aajakashayiwa zwaakabeda.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taitasi Nabakwaina Babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Mwali ngebokwe iye wakabiga mumwoyo waTaitasi kubilaila pezhulu penu sokubilaila kwakabiga munami. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Kusi kuti wakavuma chikumbilo chedu chete, koga nokusungwala kukwe ukumuzha kwamuli nokuda kukwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Watimuuntuma naye mwanakwaina unozibikana mumakubungano wose nokubhaunula kweNdebo iMbuya kukwe, <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />zwisi yezwi chete, asi iye wakashalujwa namakubungano kuti ekwende nasu pakunyamula zwipo zweshe zwatikumutila kukujwa kwaTezi nokutondeja kuzwipila kwedu kubhancha.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Atidi kuti kube nouchatipa undandu nechipo chikulwana yechi chatimukoba, <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />nokuti tilonanga zwilolulama kusi mbeli kwaTezi chete koga nomumesho abanhu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Akale naibo yaba tikumutumija mwanakwaina wedu, iye watashenengula tunji tiwana egala ekasungwalila kubhancha muzwinhu zwinji, koga ngweno ulosungwala kupinda unshaji wose nokuti unalubimbo lukulwana kwamuli. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Ndileba nezwa Tayitasi, umwe wangu akale eli unshingikwaina wangu unoshinga nami timushingila, akale nezwabanakwaina bedu yaba, batumwa bamakubungano, banobuza lukujo kunaKristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nokudalo tondejani banhu yaba busumikiji pambeli pamakubungano, oludo kuti banhu bebone chisoko chokushiya kwedu namwi.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Lubhancho Lwabadimbwi Banoshayiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ngweno azwilokwelela kuti ndimukwalile nezwompilo wolubhancho kubachena, <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />nokuti ndokuziba kuzwimisila kwenu, kunotisa kuti ndishiye namwi kumakubungano okuMasedoniya, nditi iAkeya yabakabambanyila kuvila mwakenyi, nokusungwala kwenu kwamusa banji kuti bepe. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Koga ndikumutuma banakwaina yaba kwamuli kutila kuti kushiya kwedu namwi penyaya yeyi kusi boneke samayabwe noyu unshaji, kutila kuti mube mwakabambanyila, sokuleba kwangu, <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />pamwe bamwe bokuMasedoniya bangezha nasu kova tiwana musakabambanyila, tinoolelupiswa tisinoleba nozwenu pezhulu pokubimba namwi kwakadai. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Nezwo ndasungwaja banakwaina kuti bezhe kwamuli ndisanhu, koobambanyila chipo chimwakabimbisa, kutila kuti chibambwe musinomanikijwa asi chili chipo chokuda kwenu.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Kumbulukwani yezwi, yoyo unobyala zwishoma unovuna zwishoma, koga unobyala zwinji unovuna zwinji. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Umwe noumwe ngeepe sokuyeya kukwe mundangalilo yiye, kusibe nokunyunyuta kana kubhatwa nesimba, nokuti Mwali unoda unopa ekashanta. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Mwali unotubula kumupa wose makombolelo mubunji, kuti mugunchikane muzwinhu zwose nonshaji wose akale angamupa zwinji kuti mute mishingo yose mibuya. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Sezwilokwalwa kuwhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Unomezha kosekose, unopa basheti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">bululami bubwe bunoma kwemisi isinopela.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Iye unopa imbeyu kumbyali nechinkwa cholya unoomupa akale epamija imbeyu yenu yokubyala akale nokukubusa michelo yokupa kwenu kulolulama. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Moofumiswa munzila jose nokukoba kwenu kukulwana unshaji wose, zwichoobuza kubokwa kwaMwali pezhulu pedu, <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />nokuti kuta unshingo umbuya yoku akutopeja chete busheti bwabachena, asi kunopamija kubokwa kukulwana kwaMwali. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Nokubona unshingo yoyu wokubhancha, banokuja Mwali bebona kuwhilila kwenu iNdebo iMbuya yaKristo, akale nokusupulika kwemyoyo nokukoba kwenu kwabali nokuna bamwe bose, <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />kana ibo bechinomuzwimba akale bemunamatila, pezhulu peshe jaMwali jilopamijwa munamwi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Mwali ngebokwe pezhulu pechipo chiche chinoshamisa!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paulu Unolwila Unshingo Uwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Imi, Paulu, nokwangu ndinomubweta, nobunyolo akale nokujikama kwaKristo, ndinozwininipisa kana ndakalingana namwi, koga ndilinsimu kana ndilikule namwi! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />ndomukumbila kuti kana ndilipakati penu musite kuti nditondejele busimu bundinoshingisa kuna ibo banoti mishingo yedu toitila inyika. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Kojoba tili penyika, atijikumulwana ihondo yopenyika, <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />nokuti zwilwaniso zwehondo yedu azwitoba zwopenyika asi zwinesimba lyaMwali linopilimula isimba lyombengi, topalaja unchilijano wamaniepwa, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />naizwo zwose zweshiyo zwinokoneja kuti Mwali ezibikane, akale totapa indangalilo jose kuti jiwhilile Kristo, <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />tikazwimisila kulanga kusowhilila kwose, kana kuwhilila kwenu kwapelelela. <verse eid="2CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Ilingani zwikokumbeli kwamesho enu. Kana umwe ebimba kuti ngowaKristo, ngeezwikumbuluje kuti sobwaali waKristo, nasubo tili baKristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Kojoba ndikashiya kasa nozwesimba lyedu, lyatakapiwa naTezi lyokumubaka lisi lyokumupalaja, anditooswabiswa pe. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Andidi kuboneka soti ndikumumutyisijila namakwalo. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Nokuti banoti, “Makwalo awe malemu akale ngeesimba, koga kubaipo kontumbu uwe kulelu, akale undebelekelo uwe undelu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Banhu bakadalo ngebewhisise kuti yezwo zwatinoleba mulukwalo tisipo, tozwitabo tilipo.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Atitokweja kuzwikwela kana kuzwikwejanisa nabamwe banozwitunhumwija. Asi pabanozwikwela ibo nabamwe babo, akale bezwikwejanisa ibo nabamwe babo, ibo abajilochenjela. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Koga isu atitooshiya zwilopindilija, koga toojiba pamajibijo aakatipa Mwali, zwishanganisila unshingo wedu munamwi. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Nokuti atijimuzwitalabula zwilopamijika, sokuti atijakaswika kwamuli, ndisu botanga kuswika kwamuli unshizho wose neNdebo iMbuya yaKristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Atitoshiya zwilopindilija, nemishingo yakatiwa nabamwe, asi chibimbo chedu ngechokuti nokukubuka kwoluvumilo lwenu, majibijo onshingo wedu mukati mwenu ekubuswe kasakasa, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />kutila kuti toobhaunula iNdebo iMbuya kuna jimwe inyika jikombeli kwenu, atitoshiya nonshingo watiwa kale muminda womwe.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />“Yoyo unozwitunhumwija, ngeezwitunhumwije munaTezi.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Nokuti aatoba yoyo unhu unozwitunhumwija unotambulwa, asi unhu unotunhumwijwa naTezi.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Paulu NabaPositoli Boniepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ndinachido kuti munditile moyo undefu mubulema bwangu bushomanana. Nditileni moyo undefu! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ndowha ifupa lyobumwali kunamwi, kuti ndakamubimbisa kundume umwepela uliKristo, kuti ndimupile semhandala inchena kwaali. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Koga ndotyila kuti sezwo inyoka yakachenga Eva nobutali bwayo, indangalilo jenu jinoolashika inzila yojikama nokuzwipila kuchena kunaKristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Nokuti kana umwe unhu eswika ebhaunula umwe Jesu usi utakabhaunula, kana mungatambula umwe umpepo usi umwakatambula kwatili, kana mungotambula iNdebo iMbuya ilosiyana neyamwakatambula, muzwitambula nokukambija.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ndinoyeya kuti anditoba untukutuku kana pashoma kubapositoli yabo banoshobwa bewhi bakulwana. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Kojoba ndisi imhizha mukulebeleka, luzibo ndina nalwo, takazwitondejela zwose yezwi kwamuli pachena muzwinhu zwose.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ndakachinya na kuzwininipisa kuti imwi mukujwe, nokuti ndakabhaunula iNdebo iMbuya yaMwali zwisina indipo kwamuli? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Ndakapamba kuna amwe makubungano nditambula lubhancho lunova kwabali, ndishingila imwi. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Akale pandakabeli namwi ndishayiwa, andijakanyaja unhu, nokuti zwindakabeshayiwa zwakabuzwa nabanakwaina bokuMasedoniya. Nokudalo ndakazwimisila kuti ndisimusengese bulemu, akale ndilozwimisila kuti ndisimunyaje munzila jose. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Sezwo ichokomende chaKristo chili mwandili, yoku kushiya kwangu kundinanakwo apana uchakupeja mumatunhu okuAkeya. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Akale pezhulu peni? Nokuti anditomuda na? Mwali unoziba kuti ndomuda!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Akale zwandinota ndondila mbeli ndizwita, kutila kuti ndipeje indebo jaabo banozwikwelanisa nasu mushiyo lyemishingo ibanota. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Nokuti banhu bakadalo bapositoli bamaniepwa, bashingi banochengeja, banozwita sabapositoli baKristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Akale azwitochenamisa, nokuti Satani naiye unozwifhungula sengilozi yechimuniko. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Nokudalo azwitochenamisa kana bashingi babe bezwifhungula sabashingi bobululami. Mapejelejo abo anookwendelana nemishingo yabo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujiila KwaPaulu SoMpositoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ndopamha nditi, kusibe nouchayeya kuti ndilema, koga kana mundiyeyela kuti ndilema, nditambuleni selema, kutila kuti ndishiye bo pashomanana, <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />yezwi ndozwileba musimumasimba aTezi asi selema, mukushiya yoku kwandina nakwo, <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />sezwo banji beshiya nokushiya kwenyika, namibo ndooshiya. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Nokuti motila moyo ndefu malema, imwi muli bachenjevu! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Nokuti imwi mota moyo ndefu kana unhu emuta balanda, kana kumuputelela, kana kumushingisa, kana kumudadila, kana kumumakula. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Neshoni jangu, ndolebeleka nditi, isu takabeli matela munoozo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Koga kana pelina una zwaanokweja kushiya nazwo ndikumulebeleka selema namibo ndokweja kushiya nazwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />BaHebhelu na? Namibo ndili iye. BaIzilayeli na? Namibo ndili iye. Ngibenzwalo yaAbhulahamu na? Namibo ndili iyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Bashingi baKristo na? Imi ndolebeleka sounopenga. Ndili iye umbuyanana kasa, ndimulebeleka unamishingo mikulwana kasakasa, nokusungwa kunjinji kupinda bamwe, nokulobwa zwisinolabwa, tunjinji pelyo nokusoofa. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Kashanu baJuda bakandikwabhula ishamu makumi matatu jinenshanu nena. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ndakalobwa katatu nemizato, ndakapubulwa kamwempela namabwe. Ndakakunuka katatu nobwato, ndikazhuzhuka mugungwa kamwempela busiku namasikati. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ndikaba munjendo jilopamululwa, mumakubaji enjizi, mumakubaji abapambi, mumakubaji anova kubanhu bokunasu, mumakubaji abokuzhe, igubaji muguta, igubaji mugwegulu, igubaji mugungwa, negubaji linova kubanakwaina bamaniepwa, <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />mukushingaila nomubukukutu, nokushayiwa ihope busiku, munzhala nenyota, kanji nokushayiwa kulya, mumhepo nokushayiwa zwofuka. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Akale kuzhe kwezwimwe zwinhu, pana kuchigilijwa kwamazhuba ose kokubilailila kwangu makubungano ose. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ndiani idela, imi anditoba idela? Ndiani ulotilwa kugubhulwa, imi andilonyema?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Kana ndishiya, ndoshiya nezwinhu zwinotondejela butela bwangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Mwali, Tate baTezi Jesu, iye ulokombolelwa kwemisi isinopela, unoziba kuti andijikumuniepa. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />KuDamasikasi, untongi pasi paShe Aletasi wakalinda iguta lyeDamasikusi kuti endibhate, <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Asi ndakabhelujwa muchizuma ndibhisilwa pechibwilibajimu chobulambo bweguta, ndikapuluka mumaboko awe.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Mibono neMipamulo YaPaulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ndokwelela kushiya kojoba pesina zwazwinobhancha, koga ndonda mbeli ndilebeleka nozwemibono nemipamulo inova kunaTezi. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ndoziba umwe unhulume umomunaKristo wakanyamulilwa kudenga lyetatu mumakole igumi linamana apinda, kana wakabeli mumbili kana kuzhe kombili anditoziba, Mwali unoziba. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Ndinoziba kuti unhu yoyu wakanyamululwa kuPaladiso, kuti wakabeli mumbili kana mane anditoziba, koga Mwali ndiye unoziba, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />wakawha zwinhu zwisinolebwa, zwinhu unhu zwaasingashamule. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Pezhulu poyo unhu ndoshiya, asi imi nokwangu anditoshiya, kuzhe kobutela bwangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Kana ndikada kushiya, anditoba ilema, nokuti ndoba ndilebeleka ichokomende. Asi ndozwikabula munaizwo, kutila kuti pesibe uchandikuja kupinda zwaanobona pandili kana nezwaanowha kunami.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Akale kutila kuti ndisizwikuje nobunji bwemimpamulo, ndakapiwa miwha munyama yangu, untumwa waSatani, kundijiija, kutila kuti ndisizwikuje. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Tutatu ndakateteja Tezi neezwi, kuti zwibhiswe kwandili, <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />koga iye wakati kwandili, “Chipiwo changu chilokwana kwauli, nokuti isimba lyangu linopelelejwa mubutela.” Nokudalo ndichashiya nolushanto mubutela bwangu, kutila kuti isimba lyaKristo ligale panami. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Pezhulu paKristo, nino, ndinogunchikana nobutela, kutukwa, bukukutu, kuyangatiswa, nemhalajo, nokuti pandili idela, ndipo pandinesimba.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubilaila KwaPaulu Pezhulu PabaKolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ndakazwita ilema! Ndimwi mwakatisa kuti ndite alo, nokuti ndakabekwelela kulebelekelwa namwi. Nokuti andiipo pasi muchimilo kuna yaba banowhi bapositoli babuyanana, kojoba imi ndisichinhu. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Zwitondejelo zwobupositoli bwechokomende zwakatiwa pakati penu nokugontama, nezwitondejelo, nezwichenamiso, nemishingo mikulwana. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ani imwi mwakataijisilwani zwakapiwa mamwe makubungano, kuzhe kwokuti imi nokwangu andijakamulemeja? Ndibhatileni luchinyo yolu!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ngweno ndilozwibambila kuzha kwamuli ketatu. Akale anditooba untolo, nokuti apana chenu chandinoshaka asi imwi, nokuti bana abatoba ibo banokwelela kulela bazwali, asi bazwali ndibo banokwelela kulela bana babo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Imi ndoshantila kulipa zwandinanazo nokuda kobupenyu bwenu. Kana ndimuda kasa, imi ndilokwelela kudiwa zwishomanana na?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Sezwo ndisakaba untolo kwamuli, koga imwi munoti ndinchengeji, akale bamwe bangayeya kuti ndakamukoma nobutali! <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ndakamuputelela na, naabo bandakatumija kwamuli? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ndakasungwaja Taitasi kuti ende, akale ndikatumija noumwe mwanakwaina. Taitasi wakamuputelela na? Atijakata nenzila imwempela na? Atijakatola matanho mamwempela na?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Mubweni soti tikumulebeleka yezwi tizwilwila na? Mane! Tikumulebeleka mbeli kwaMwali sabashingi baKristo, zwose zwitilwa kuti mubakike banodikana. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ndikumutyila kuti pamwe pandichaswika ndoowana musi sezwo zwandinoda, namibo mundiwana ndisili sezwamunoda. Ndotyila kuti kungaba nebhopoto, ifupa, kunyema, lulyo, kupita, kunyeya, ishiyo, nenyonganyonga. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ndotyila kuti pakuswika kwangu akale posa Mwali wangu unoondiswabisa mbeli kwenu, akale ndikalilila banji baabo bakachinya ntolo, basijakazwifija kubushambwa, busangu, nezwinosheshemesa zwibakata.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Chichenjejo Nokulezwa Kopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Yoku kushanya kwangu kwetatu ndizha kwamuli. Undandu unosimiswa nobusumikiji bwabasumikiji babili kana batatu. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ndakabachenjeja yabo bakachinya kutanga nabamwe bose, nangweno ndikumubachenjeja ndisipo, sezwandakata ndilinamwi pakushanya kwangu kwebili, kuti kana ndingozha kabili anditoobawhila ishe, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />nokuti moda chisimatijo chokuti Kristo unolebeleka munami. Kristo aajiloshayiwa isimba lyokumulanga, asi unesimba mukati mwenu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Nokuti wakakahamililwa mukudemuka, asi umpenyu musimba lyaMwali. Isu tinabutela muna iye, asi mukukamujana namwi toogala naye mumasimba aMwali.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Zwipenyenguleni nokwenu, mubone kuti mulobhatilila mukudimbwa kwenu. Zwikwejeni nokwenu. Amuzwibweni na, kuti Jesu Kristo umo munamwi? Kuzhe kokuti muchokomende mukonelwe ikwejo! <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ndinobimba kuti munowana kuti atijakakonelwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Koga tonamata kunaMwali kuti imwi musite chibi, kusi kuti isu tiboneke tili batubula ikwejo, asi kutila kuti imwi mute zwilolulama, kojoba isu tiboneka tilibakonelwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Nokuti atingate chinhu chinonyenyejana nechokomende, koga zwinosimatija ichokomende chete. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Nokuti toshanta kana tilimatela imwi muli nesimba. Zwatinonamatila kunyamuka kwenu. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ndikumukwala yezwi ndisinamwi, kutila kuti kana ndaswika ndisibe nobukali ndishingisa isimba lindakapiwa naTezi lili lyokubaka lisi lyokukolomola.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Pakupejeleja, banakwaina, sosalani zwenu. llulamisani inzila jenu, tobelani kubweteja kwangu, ivumilanani umwe noumwe, mugale nolunyalalo, nezwo Mwali woludo nolunyalalo unoba namwi. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Imusanani nokumusana kuchena kobwanakwaina. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Bachena bubalile bakumumusa. <verse eid="2CO 13:13" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Chipiwo chaShe Jesu Kristo, noludo lwaMwali, nokukamujana kwoMpepo uNchena ngazwibe namwi mwose. <verse eid="2CO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Chipiwo chaTezi Jesu Kristo noludo lwaMwali nokulyijana koMpepo uNchena kube namwi mose.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>